{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122285","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122285/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122285/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122285/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122285","id":5115089517,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc79QNVw","number":122285,"title":"Optimize TextEdit underline update and drawing","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-08-10T23:07:20Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T19:22:22Z","closed_at":"2026-08-11T08:49:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122285","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122285","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122285.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122285.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Optimizes TextEdit underline update and drawing from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588\r\n- by using LocalVector that keep memory between updates and avoids Vector CoW farming.\r\n- by changing functions to accept temp LocalVectors to update to avoid returning new allocated Vectors.\r\n- by using a static 2d line Mesh to create all underlines lines in one update and draw.\r\n\r\nWith dev build and an editor CodeEdit full of errors that feature did cost about 2000 ms on each draw update. With the changes in this PR it costs about 300 ms in dev build which is roughly what a mouse rect select costs to put things into perspective.\r\n\r\nMost of the performance cost left is\r\n\r\n- 1/3 the Variant Array creation for the mesh.\r\nCan not really be optimized more with e.g. vertex region updates because the array size changes all the time\r\n- 1/3 the actual mesh creation on the RenderingServer API and internals.\r\nCan not really be optimized more as the server needs to create the fresh surface.\r\n- 1/3 Processing for the actual underlines, aka creating the points array\r\nCan be optimized more in small parts like the point creation to avoid some writes. Would require more code changes.\r\n\r\nIf someone wants a noticeable bigger performance gain it likely requires to replace the entire line drawing logic with a simple \"quad\" shader.","closed_by":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122285/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122285/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}